  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 05bc19b3ecb135c42ac63f5173f2ded6, type: 3}
  m_Name: Patrolls' Rations DIALOGUE SET
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::FavourDialogueSet
  unavailable: 
  offer: Well, we cannot forget our defences. For starters, we need to keep our patrollers
    on their feet. Speaking of, Patroll master Bjursig should be low on rations by
    now- he has been patrolling the south for days. Give him some rations, will ye?
  active: Did you found patroll master Bjursig yet? If he is still alive, he should
    be patrolling the southern regions of the realm.
  readyToTurnIn: Who are you? Oh, some fresh food finally! Mm, well maybe not fresh-
    but still food. Thank you stranger.
